<div type="letter">
<pb facs="1038519" n="166v"/>
  <p><lb/>Su<choice><orig><g ref="#mm">&#xE5D2;</g></orig><reg>mm</reg></choice>as Tibi ago gratias cum pro eo, quod posthabitis negotiis petitioni me<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>
      <lb/>locum dare, et hesterna die (qua ipsa die egomet <add>quoque</add> sed alia via respondi) <rs type="person">amico</rs>
      <lb/>meo <rs key="place_GEO-3169070" type="place">Rom<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></rs> degenti ad <rs type="letter">litteras</rs> suas respondere volueris; tum pro eo, quod et
      <lb/>operam et nomen Tuum offeras pro coercendis illius <rs type="person">nebulonis</rs> calumniis; sed
      <lb/>non necesse erit, ut Tibi molestiam aliquam <choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> pessimo isto homine arcessas,
      <lb/>fortassis ipse (quod tamen incertum est) brevibus respondebo in <subst><del>D</del><add>T</add></subst>omo proxi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>mo <rs type="keyword">Diarii</rs><note type="comment">Im 1719 erschienen Band 30 und 31 des GLI ist nichts dazu erschienen.</note>, de qua re pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>sens Tecum agam; nunc et Lectiones habend<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> et
      <lb/>alia agenda, pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>cipue responsiones faciend<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> ad plures quas domo accepi
      <lb/><rs type="letter">epistolas</rs>, tempus omne mihi auferunt. Heri accepi <rs type="lostletter">litteras</rs> <choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> <rs type="person">Patruele</rs>
      <lb/>meo, in quibus <rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-118509969">Patrem</rs> suum excusat, quod propter plurima, eaque gravia,
      <lb/>negotia, quorum aliqua mihi indicavit, non vacare possit <subst><del><gap/></del><add>l</add></subst>ectioni <rs type="biblio" key="biblio_BS83R2A4 biblio_M3G2JA79">scri<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>ptorum</rs> Tuorum; id quod mihi Tui gratia valde displicet. Addidit se
<pb facs="1038520" n="167r"/>
      <lb/>mihi misisse per <rs type="person">Germanum aliquem Doctorem Medicum</rs> huc venturum
      <lb/>exemplar unum <rs type="biblio" key="biblio_V5AVH8QR">Dissertationis de <subst><del>Cir</del><add>M</add></subst>orbis <choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> circulatione <abbr><choice><orig><g ref="#etlig">&amp;</g></orig><reg>et</reg></choice>c.</abbr></rs> quod, quam<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>primum accepero, subito ad Te transmittam.</p> <closer><salute>Vale.</salute> <dateline><rs key="place_GEO-3171728" type="place">Patavii</rs> <abbr>d.</abbr> <date when="1718-11-27">27. <abbr>9bris</abbr> 1718.</date></dateline></closer>
</div>
</body>
</text></TEI>